// Generate the PS4 persistence-definition override shipped in Northstar.PS4.
//
// This console build uses persistence version 929; PC Titanfall 2, and therefore
// stock Northstar, uses 231. The engine asks each mod for
// cfg/server/persistent_player_data_version_929.pdef and falls back to the stock
// one, so the pdef Northstar ships is never even requested.
//
// That matters because the stock 929 definition is disc-era: it predates a large
// part of the stat surface the game's own sh_stats.gnut registers. Vanilla gets
// away with it, because vanilla's _items.nut never asks for the stats that do not
// resolve. Northstar ships PC's _items.nut, which registers unlock challenges
// against them, and an unresolved lookup is a hard script error that kills the
// lobby before it is playable:
//
//     SCRIPT ERROR: [SERVER] The index "speedball" does not exist
//      -> return shGlobalMP.playerStatVars[ category ][ alias ][ subAlias ].statVar
//
// Rather than guess, the required surface is derived from two files that ship
// with the game itself:
//
//   * sh_stats.gnut, extracted from englishclient_frontend.bsp, names the
//     persistence path of every stat this build registers. Resolving all 191 of
//     them against the stock 929 definition leaves 49 unresolved. Those 49 are
//     exactly what this script adds.
//   * PC's 231 definition supplies the declarations, so what is added matches
//     what PC Northstar expects rather than being invented here.
//
// Everything is APPENDED. These enums size fixed arrays and the structs are laid
// out in order, so inserting in the middle would silently repoint every stat
// after the insertion point.
//
// Keeping _items.nut byte-identical to PC's is the point: the divergence lives
// here, in one PS4-only file, instead of in Northstar's scripts.
//
// Usage:  python tools/pdef/build_ps4_pdef.py [stock_929.pdef] [output.pdef]

// Enums the stock 929 definition lacks; see NEW_ENUMS in the generator.

$ENUM_START titanExecution
	execution_ion
	execution_ion_prime
	execution_tone
	execution_tone_prime
	execution_ronin
	execution_ronin_prime
	execution_northstar
	execution_northstar_prime
	execution_legion
	execution_legion_prime
	execution_vanguard
	execution_scorch
	execution_scorch_prime
	execution_random_0
	execution_random_1
	execution_random_2
	execution_random_3
	execution_random_4
	execution_random_5
	execution_random_6
$ENUM_END

